{"version":1,"content":"<p>【漏洞連環爆 ⚠️】IT 人今晚不用睡了 !! 繼 PHP 爆出兩個重大 RCE 漏洞，無須認證即可遠端攻擊，目前官方已釋出更新。</p><p>沒想到同一時間 Node.js 與 Go 亦緊急釋出安全更新，修補可能導致無憑證遠端執行程式碼（RCE）的重大漏洞、TLS 憑證驗證繞過以及私鑰外洩的中間 CA 信任鏈風險，所以今晚大家一齊打「丁*」吧 !! (編者按︰補丁)</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T17:21:28.031252+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":179,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T17:15:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T02:17:52.363755+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T17:17:43.305296+00:00","content_hash":"cbdaaaf0aa56d341dbf7711f1f71e0b0a9d2797a59f0ed6c8028ba306405d8ef","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}